# Overrides the plain .dockerignore for `docker build -f Dockerfile.prod` (BuildKit picks
# <dockerfile-name>.dockerignore over the plain one when present). Dockerfile.prod's COPY list is
# already explicit (CMakeLists.txt, src/, test/, config/), so this only needs to keep local build
# artifacts out - unlike the plain .dockerignore it must NOT exclude config/, since this image has
# no runtime bind mount and needs it baked in.
build/
build_local/
